rially sectioned along superior to inferior axis  The breast parenchyma surrounding the biopsy cavity shows diffuse foci of fat necrosis  Representative sections are sequentially submitted from superior to inferior as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   En face section  superior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  biopsy cavity to include closest margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  breast parenchyma away from mass   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Radial section  inferior margin  Received fresh  labeled  breast superior margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm unoriented  partially fragmented portion of tan yellow lobulated fibroadipose tissue  serially sectioned  and submitted entirely as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  left breast inferior margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm irregular tan yellow lobulated fibroadipose tissue  submitted entirely as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  left breast lateral margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm unoriented portion of tan yellow lobulated fibroadipose tissue  serially sectioned  and submitted entirely as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by Kristina Braaten M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION PART B  BREAST  LEFT SUPERIOR FINAL MARGIN   EXCISION PART C  BREAST  LEFT INFERIOR FINAL MARGIN   EXCISION PART D  BREAST  LEFT LATERAL FINAL MARGIN   EXCISION  report_end  , Unknown.
